The addition of two integers works by taking one integer and increasing it's value by the value of the other integer.
  EX: 15 + 4, Take the integer 15 and icrease its value 4 times.
           +1   +2   +3   +4
      15 → 16 → 17 → 18 → 19
      15 + 4 = 19
  EX2: 10 + 4
           +1   +2   +3   +4
      10 → 11 → 12 → 13 → 14
      10 + 4 = 14